* Edit 1: Convert to common-source with shunt-peaked LC tank at drain
* Adds PMOS cascode (PM1) and shunt capacitor (C3) to form LC tank at drain
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n0 VSS VSS
PMOS PM1 VDD n3 n2 VDD
L L2 n3 VDD
C C2 n3 VOUT1
C C3 n2 VDD
R R1 VDD n4
NMOS NM3 n4 n4 VSS VSS
R R2 n4 n0
C Cbyp n0 VSS